zed after all packets were opened.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":14,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":"5bc8f949-d92b-4936-a61a-69fbb0604135","test_id":"70767467-ea94-5677-9212-77a335806796","prompt":"Passage B · Every packet in the archive was tested.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":15,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":"207f52d6-61a1-4569-9f04-c8005caf5f73","test_id":"70767467-ea94-5677-9212-77a335806796","prompt":"Passage B · The team kept some material untouched.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":16,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":"fb01bf3a-61c9-452f-b570-9a1a9027b5ab","test_id":"70767467-ea94-5677-9212-77a335806796","prompt":"Passage B · The cool treatment lasted exactly seven days.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":17,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":"7150f89c-ac6b-4a62-a0cb-3c00a6c41920","test_id":"70767467-ea94-5677-9212-77a335806796","prompt":"Passage B · All tested species benefited from cooling.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":18,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":"7618cbaf-4f73-4757-9286-55cbc2628f7e","test_id":"70767467-ea94-5677-9212-77a335806796","prompt":"Passage B · Some barley seeds grew into seedlings.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":19,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":"6504eea7-23ea-442a-82e3-b0b348f8df27","test_id":"70767467-ea94-5677-9212-77a335806796","prompt":"Passage B · The isolated greenhouse reduced the risk of crossing with modern varieties.","options":["True","False","Not Given"],"position":20,"type":"true_false_not_given","config":{},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":""},{"id":