ishes observed effects from predictions. In this sentence, what does “distinguishes” most nearly mean?","options":["separates","combines","calculates","questions"],"position":0,"type":"multiple_choice","config":{"sat_topic":"Craft and Structure"},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":"Words in Context"},{"id":"8a2de7b8-ab02-46ff-8cc1-7568530475b8","test_id":"9c4d7708-f642-5cca-9458-57c66aa2f1b7","prompt":"The island’s steep slopes constrain where houses can be built. In this sentence, what does “constrain” most nearly mean?","options":["identify","expand","conceal","limit"],"position":1,"type":"multiple_choice","config":{"sat_topic":"Craft and Structure"},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":"Words in Context"},{"id":"5f82b163-2ce2-4571-af71-73fd53805b02","test_id":"9c4d7708-f642-5cca-9458-57c66aa2f1b7","prompt":"The document offers a plausible account of the unexplained delay. In this sentence, what does “plausible” most nearly mean?","options":["contradictory","complete","believable","official"],"position":2,"type":"multiple_choice","config":{"sat_topic":"Craft and Structure"},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":"Words in Context"},{"id":"cb4a85c2-4519-4465-91a8-4800f7b007e5","test_id":"9c4d7708-f642-5cca-9458-57c66aa2f1b7","prompt":"The researchers devised a new method of measuring rainfall. In this sentence, what does “devised” most nearly mean?","options":["criticized","designed","abandoned","copied"],"position":3,"type":"multiple_choice","config":{"sat_topic":"Craft and Structure"},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":"Words in Context"},{"id":"8e8eee9a-da65-4296-98fe-ffc07e68315f","test_id":"9c4d7708-f642-5cca-9458-57c66aa2f1b7","prompt":"A sudden increase in demand accelerated production. In this sentence, what does “accelerated” most nearly mean?","options":["sped up","stopped","reduced","financed"],"position":4,"type":"multiple_choice","config":{"sat_topic":"Craft and Structure"},"points":1,"required":true,"group_name":"Words in Context"},{"id"